# Site mirrors

This page summarizes all the mirrors of this site. Agreeably, that's all a bit overkill (given the importance of this internet presence), but I did it for fun.

All sites listed below are reachable via IPv4 as well as via IPv6.

## Gemini protocol

=> gemini://foo.zone gemini://foo.zone - Falkenstein, Germany
=> gemini://www.foo.zone gemini://www.foo.zone - Tokyo, Japan

Wondering what's the Gemini protocol about? Read:

=> ./gemfeed/2021-04-24-welcome-to-the-geminispace.gmi Welcome to the Geminispace

## HTTP protocol

=> https://foo.zone https://foo.zone - Falkenstein, Germany
=> https://www.foo.zone https://www.foo.zone - Tokyo, Japan
=> https://www2.buetow.org https://www2.buetow.org - Codeberg page, somewhere in Germany

That's all for now...

=> ./ Go back to the main site
